# GitHub Linguist Configuration

# Mark mock seed data and generated lockfiles so they don't skew repository statistics
server/src/utils/seedData.js linguist-vendored
*.lock linguist-generated
*-lock.json linguist-generated
package-lock.json linguist-generated

# Ensure client markup and styling are accurately counted
*.html linguist-detectable=true
*.css linguist-detectable=true
*.jsx linguist-detectable=true

